instructions:
Desktop:
WASD - move;
E - interact;
Mouse - camera rotate;
M - shop;
J - daily tasks;
H - daily reward;
Tab - show/hide cursor;
P - pause;

Open a restaurant and create a unique design.
Take orders and cook in a realistic kitchen simulator.
Discover new dishes: milkshakes, desserts, snacks.
Improve the kitchen, hire chefs and train staff.
Happy customers = tips + reputation!

The goal of the game is to destroy all zombies and monsters.
Find new weapons in the boxes.
Upgrade characters and weapons to defeat strong enemies.

Q (K) - change weapons;
W, A, S, D (arrows) - move;
E (M) - apply / activate;
F (J) - super weapon.
X, Space (L, KeyPad 0) - shooting;
Mouse - look / shoot;
For mobile devices, use touch input.
